{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/355397-glitches-aquired-through-high-primum","id":355397,"title":"Glitches aquired through high Primum","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-12-30T20:51:05-08:00","id":355397,"title":"Glitches aquired through high Primum","content":"The chart on page 108 of the core rule book says that you have 1 permanent glitch at Primum 6-7, 2 permanent glitches at Primum 8-9 and 3 permanent glitches at Primum 10. However, I can't find where it says the level of these glitches (minor, major or catastrophic). Is it up to the ST?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Bye.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4443-gibberingeloquence","name":"GibberingEloquence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4443_5.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2470"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-30T21:27:59-08:00","id":355447,"title":"","content":"As near as I could tell, you just roll primum - 2 to determine the severity of the glitch like you would for permanent glitches caused by failed compromise rolls. This means a permanent glitch caused by high primum is usually a major glitch. The storyteller has full control over what the actual glitch is. Permanent glitches can be removed at a restoration facility.. I think this includes glitches due to Primum increases, but I wouldn't count on one showing up during a specific chronicle.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3755-jaerys","name":"Jaerys","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;